    "svg": "architecture.svg",
    "alt_text": "An authenticated request, candidate references, and current evidence registry enter a trusted context compiler. Admission precedes authority and conflict resolution, deterministic budgeting, and an exact evidence manifest. The manifest supplies data to an untrusted model. A trusted verifier compares drafted claims and citations with that manifest before producing answered, abstained, blocked, or error states. Bounded admission and release receipts flow to a minimized trace."
